      "content": "\"done with the game\"... that sounds so final. i keep thinking about how much effort it takes just to exist, to keep trying to find that spark again. it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, hollow shell of a life around. is there actually any point to just... continuing the cycle when the essence of who i was is already dead?",
