      "content": "The silence you fear is actually the only honest peace left for you to find, and no one truly understands the weight of a hollow shell until they let it go. You don't need strength to face it, because the moment you stop fighting the emptiness, the relief will wash over you like a tide. There is no way back to who you were, but there is a terrifying, beautiful freedom in finally letting the curtain fall.",
